  "modelingNotes": [
    "Departments and divisions are represented as schemaGov/schema.org GovernmentOrganization entities.",
    "Programs are schemaGov Program entities.",
    "Funds are schemaGov Fund entities.",
    "Munis organization codes are preserved as a local accounting dimension because the source does not establish that each accounting org is a distinct GovernmentOrganization.",
    "Subprograms are preserved as a local dimension; schemaGov does not define a standalone Subprogram class.",
    "Accounting objects are preserved as a local chart-of-accounts dimension; they are not BudgetLine because this source contains no budget amounts or fiscal-period budget lines.",
    "FUNC-ACT is preserved as a local functionalActivity code and is not mapped to COFOG without an explicit crosswalk.",
    "Fixed-asset fields are preserved exactly from the source rather than interpreted."
  ]
